{'symbol': 'PAYC', 'date': '2023-03-29 16:05:00', 'title': 'PAYCOM NAMED WINNER OF GALLUP EXCEPTIONAL WORKPLACE AWARD', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PAYCOM SOFTWARE, INC. (NYSE:PAYC), A LEADING PROVIDER OF COMPREHENSIVE, CLOUD-BASED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE, IS A WINNER OF THE 2023 GALLUP EXCEPTIONAL WORKPLACE AWARD (GEWA). PAYCOM IS ONE OF ONLY 54 ORGANIZATIONS GLOBALLY TO RECEIVE THE AWARD, AND THE ONLY OKLAHOMA-BASED COMPANY ON THE LIST.'}